+  op_part
  '  A transclusion record at the next index under a parent.
  \  b=bowl cur=myth view=axal[myth] at=nat part=nat data=nat
  ^  yell
  ?>  (./some parent) (parse_rel at)
      (yell [] cur)
  ?  (eq 0 (cord/len part))
     (yell [] cur)
  =  idx  (next_idx view.dip(parent))
  =  p  b.here.weld(parent).snoc(($u idx))
